{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queue Queen is a game like <strong>Balatro</strong> and <strong>Nubby's Number Factory</strong> where you stack cards, trigger items and build game-breaking combos to clear the rounds in a limited time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than\u00a0<strong>2000\u00a0</strong>items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All items are procedurally generated, so there are over 2000 of them with unique effects!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have white items which trigger when cards are evaluated after you've filled your stack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow items trigger at any time when something happens, even in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pink items are like yellow items, but they have more powerful effects and can't be force triggered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue items grant passive bonuses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tailor your build using the Cardmage Parlor and the Backroom Printer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Cardmage Parlor</strong> lets you buy/clone/destroy cards or give them buffs which trigger at different times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the\u00a0<strong>Backroom Printer</strong> you can merge, duplicate or edit your items to build even stronger combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show up often and keep the game challenging. They can discard your stack, or swap your items around, or forcibly sell them, so plan for them accordingly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode after a victory to see how far your build can go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game +, up to NG+7. Each NG+ expands your inventory and stack size by 1 and also increases the required points for each round.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941130?t=1764601684","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941130?t=1764601684","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/ec553252c1250d9546c1f1fc42d79f2957ff9e6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764601684","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/ec553252c1250d9546c1f1fc42d79f2957ff9e6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764601684","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4081060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queue Queen is a game like <strong>Balatro</strong> and <strong>Nubby's Number Factory</strong> where you stack cards, trigger items and build game-breaking combos to clear the rounds in a limited time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than\u00a0<strong>2000\u00a0</strong>items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All items are procedurally generated, so there are over 2000 of them with unique effects!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have white items which trigger when cards are evaluated after you've filled your stack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow items trigger at any time when something happens, even in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pink items are like yellow items, but they have more powerful effects and can't be force triggered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue items grant passive bonuses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tailor your build using the Cardmage Parlor and the Backroom Printer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Cardmage Parlor</strong> lets you buy/clone/destroy cards or give them buffs which trigger at different times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the\u00a0<strong>Backroom Printer</strong> you can merge, duplicate or edit your items to build even stronger combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show up often and keep the game challenging. They can discard your stack, or swap your items around, or forcibly sell them, so plan for them accordingly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode after a victory to see how far your build can go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game +, up to NG+7. Each NG+ expands your inventory and stack size by 1 and also increases the required points for each round.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lisisoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941130/a2e48650d002ded435fb36d3fbffc0268e943dc8/header.jpg?t=1764601684","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Debian 12 equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual Core equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1+ compatible card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M (Macbook 2013 and new