/3941130/d03a592b7c55a43120c8c600b64d77510d4b23a8/ss_d03a592b7c55a43120c8c600b64d77510d4b23a8.600x338.jpg?t=1764601684"}],"short_description":"A card-stacking roguelike where you quickly stack cards and trigger items to get points. Discover over 10 million different items and make synergistic builds by customizing your deck and inventory to reach higher scores and break the game.","steam_appid":3941130,"support_info":{"email":"nikaoto@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}